  Split out of kotoba.lang.process on 2026-09-09 (ADR-2609091200). The unit
  here is the DEFINITION, and this repo's deps.edn names exactly the
  definitions it reaches -- nothing else.
"
  
    (:require [ :as cp])
)

(def max-arg-bytes 4096)
